   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Upon admission to the orthopaedic surgery service, the medicine \nservice was consulted to assess for pre-operative risk given her \nmultiple co-morbid conditions, and they determined that she was \nstable to undergo surgical repair of the hip fracture.",
